# Line endings must be identical everywhere: they are part of the bytes that end
# up inside assets/, and F-Droid rebuilds on Linux compare those bytes with the
# release APK. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true produces
# a different APK from the same commit.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.so binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
